<<bgm_stop>>
<<show pyo_horror>>
EunPyo: Who's that behind you?
<<wait 2>>
<<bgm_resume>>
<<show pyo_neg>>
EunPyo: I'd prefer it if it were just the two of us talking.
<<show pyo_idle>>
<<choice_again>>
